  <!-- ===================== RC JET ===================== -->
  <article class="sheet" id="rc-jet">
    <header>
      <h2>RC Jet</h2>
      <p>A radio-controlled jet built from scratch around a 70&nbsp;mm electric ducted fan. Foam boards and hobbyist electronics, no kits.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="row stack">
      <div class="text">
        <div>
          <h3>What I did</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Built the airframe from foam boards and hobbyist electronics.</li>
            <li>Designed the aircraft and its exit tube in Autodesk Fusion 360.</li>
            <li>Implemented a gyroscope that stabilizes the plane during flight.</li>
            <li>Maintained controlled flight.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="exhaust">
          <div>
            <h3>Sizing the exhaust</h3>
            <p>Thrust depends on how the exit tube is sized against the fan. I researched intake and exit diameters for maximum thrust, compared options in an exit-diameter calculator, then modeled the tube in Fusion 360 and drew it up.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="zoomable diagram"><button class="zoom" type="button"><img src="projects/rc-jet/images/exhaust-model.png" width="304" height="625" loading="lazy" alt="3D model of the tapered exhaust tube"></button><figcaption>Tube model</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery diagram">
        <figure class="zoomable"><button class="zoom" type="button"><img src="projects/rc-jet/images/jet-cad.png" width="728" height="528" loading="lazy" alt="Fusion 360 model of the jet, dark gray with wings, tail, and internal fan housing"></button><figcaption>Fusion 360 model</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="zoomable"><button class="zoom" type="button"><img src="projects/rc-jet/images/jet-drawing.png" width="955" height="621" loading="lazy" alt="Multi-view technical drawing of the RC jet with dimensions"></button><figcaption>Multi-view drawing</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="zoomable"><button class="zoom" type="button"><img src="projects/rc-jet/images/exhaust-calculator.png" width="1268" height="803" loading="lazy" alt="Exhaust exit diameter calculator listing exit diameters for single and dual outlets at different area percentages"></button><figcaption>Exit-diameter calculator</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="zoomable"><button class="zoom" type="button"><img src="projects/rc-jet/images/exhaust-drawing.png" width="1064" height="669" loading="lazy" alt="Technical drawing of the tapered exhaust tube"></button><figcaption>Exhaust tube drawing</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class="titleblock">
      <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Designer and builder</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Tools</dt><dd>Fusion 360, foam board, hobbyist electronics</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Controlled flight with gyro stabilization</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Write-up</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO/tree/main/projects/rc-jet">On GitHub</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </article>

